# himalaya-mcp - Email MCP Server & Claude Code Plugin
# Privacy-first email access via himalaya CLI

## Project: himalaya-mcp
## Type: mcp-server / claude-code-plugin
## Status: v2.1.0 released (main/Homebrew/marketplace/aggregator), dev synced
## Focus: Post-release verification — v2.1.0 shipped
## Phase: Maintenance
## Priority: 1
## Progress: 100

